\nunknown shorthand flag: 'l' in -l\\nUsage:\\n  task-board [command]\\n\\nAvailable Commands:\\n  admin                  Server administration (users, tokens, access)\\n  boards                 List boards accessible to the current user (remote mode)\\n  claude                 Launch Claude through the Task-board Session Manager\\n  codex                  Attach Codex to the Task-board Session Manager\\n  completion             Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\\n  export                 Export current board into a tar.gz archive\\n  goal                   Read and align the board-scoped parent primary goal\\n  grep                   Full-text search across board files\\n  handoff                Verify role handoff evidence and move to the role end status\\n  help                   Help about any command\\n  import                 Import a tar.gz archive into the current board\\n  init                   Install task-board project integrations\\n  limits                 Inspect and control provider rate-limit state\\n  login                  Store a token for the current remote\\n  logout                 Remove active user's token for current remote\\n  m                      Execute a mutation (write operation)\\n  migrate-keychain       Import legacy remote credentials into macOS Keychain\\n  migrate-project-config Preview or apply guarded deprecated project-config alias migration\\n  plan                   Show execution plan with phases and critical path\\n  q                      Query the board with a mini DSL\\n  repair-links           List or remove unsupported container dependency links\\n  resource               Upload, update, download, and delete board resources\\n  self-update            Update task-board to the latest version\\n  session                Inspect and stop Task-board Session Manager sessions\\n  spawn                  Queue an agent spawn run for a board task\\n  switch-user            Switch active user for current remote\\n  tree                   Show board as hierarchical t\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5030,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1258,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
